{
  "case": "G27",
  "rule": "a strut bearing on a shoe mitred square to it",
  "design": "shoe long point 75.00, centre line 60.00, short point 45.00; 36.87°. Strut 900.00, square, its end moved -100.00. With spacer_mm 8: 892.00. With n1 at z = 100: shoe 95.00, 80.00, 65.00; strut 884.00. Strut redrawn (140,0,380)->(620,0,20): shoe 86.67, 60.00, 33.33; 53.13°; strut 500.00. With the normal typed as (3, 0, -4) instead, that redraw is an angled-end error on b3.b (16.26°), and b3 is 600.00",
  "expect": {
    "bars": {
      "b1": { "cut_mm": 1000 },
      "b2": {
        "cut_mm": 75,
        "centre_mm": 60,
        "short_mm": 45,
        "ends": { "a": { "by": "c1", "move_mm": 0 }, "b": { "by": "plane", "angle_deg": 36.87 } }
      },
      "b3": {
        "cut_mm": 900,
        "centre_mm": 900,
        "ends": { "b": { "by": "c2", "move_mm": -100, "angle_deg": 0 } }
      }
    },
    "errors": []
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "spacer_mm 8",
      "patch": { "connections": { "c2": { "spacer_mm": 8 } } },
      "expect": { "bars": { "b3": { "cut_mm": 892 } }, "errors": [] }
    },
    {
      "name": "n1 at z = 100",
      "patch": { "nodes": { "n1": [540, 0, 100] } },
      "expect": {
        "bars": {
          "b2": { "cut_mm": 95, "centre_mm": 80, "short_mm": 65 },
          "b3": { "cut_mm": 884 }
        },
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "strut redrawn",
      "patch": { "bars": { "b3": { "a": [140, 0, 380], "b": [620, 0, 20] } } },
      "expect": {
        "bars": {
          "b2": {
            "cut_mm": 86.67,
            "centre_mm": 60,
            "short_mm": 33.33,
            "ends": { "b": { "angle_deg": 53.13 } }
          },
          "b3": { "cut_mm": 500, "ends": { "b": { "by": "c2", "move_mm": -100 } } }
        },
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "strut redrawn, normal typed",
      "patch": {
        "bars": {
          "b2": { "ends": { "b": { "plane": { "normal": [3, 0, -4] } } } },
          "b3": { "a": [140, 0, 380], "b": [620, 0, 20] }
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "bars": { "b3": { "cut_mm": 600, "ends": { "b": { "by": "default" } } } },
        "errors": [{ "code": "angled-end", "entity": "b3.b", "refs": ["c2"] }]
      }
    }
  ]
}
